{"matched":39,"pages":[{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0327a01","n":"0327a","t":"楞伽阿䟦多羅寶經記卷第一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0327b01","n":"0327b","t":"識境界不可具述因問楞伽山"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0327c01","n":"0327c","t":"五百由旬而為煩惱生死夜叉"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0328a01","n":"0328a","t":"此心而為眾生開示者直指此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0328b01","n":"0328b","t":"記曰此敘說法由致也如是我"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0328c01","n":"0328c","t":"遊者摩帝此亦云慧所謂達者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0329a01","n":"0329a","t":"云如實見者名為正見若他見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0329b01","n":"0329b","t":"說百八句表對治百八煩惱非"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0330a01","n":"0330a","t":"相通指二土謂實報莊嚴土凡"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0330c01","n":"0330c","t":"界眾生見今而有遷變無常為"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0331a01","n":"0331a","t":"究竟佛地何等下四句問正智"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0331c01","n":"0331c","t":"記曰從誰生諸寶性至此蓋問"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0332a01","n":"0332a","t":"記曰此問法之差別也悉檀者"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0332c01","n":"0332c","t":"雖經來未盡而此四卷之文所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0333a01","n":"0333a","t":"但其語隨便故參差不類其意"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0333c01","n":"0333c","t":"摩沙豆也陀那銖也迦利沙那"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0334b01","n":"0334b","t":"之問記曰此五句乃讚大慧所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0334c01","n":"0334c","t":"佛教所明不出四句而外道所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0335a01","n":"0335a","t":"句非數句與吾靈覺何交涉不"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0336b01","n":"0336b","t":"所說則一切皆非故此結云此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0336c01","n":"0336c","t":"心真如者即是一法界大總相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0337a01","n":"0337a","t":"是第八識精應緣之業用三相"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0337b01","n":"0337b","t":"生滅門有覺不覺義耳下文云"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0337c01","n":"0337c","t":"現眾色像現識亦爾隨其五塵"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0338a01","n":"0338a","t":"三細也言不思議熏變者謂真"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0339a01","n":"0339a","t":"證無生是則八識但滅戲論虗"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0339b01","n":"0339b","t":"其計云記曰此出外道妄計生"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0339c01","n":"0339c","t":"四大是實是常能生有情謂極"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0340a01","n":"0340a","t":"能生諸法由是觀之則前五乃"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0340c01","n":"0340c","t":"也魏譯云諸愚癡凡夫無有實"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0341a01","n":"0341a","t":"斯正以苦欲捨苦依止此諸見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0341b01","n":"0341b","t":"指上內外二種外道謂彼外道"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0341c01","n":"0341c","t":"想所見妄作異因總是無因若"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0342a01","n":"0342a","t":"斷滅戲論悉空無益且此邪見"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0342b01","n":"0342b","t":"唯心所現如幻境界方得現證"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0342c01","n":"0342c","t":"分別境也受用建立乃外器界"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0343b01","n":"0343b","t":"度自心現無所有得住般若波"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0343c01","n":"0343c","t":"業流識漸次淨除故謂漸修所"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/X17n0326-1_p0344a01","n":"0344a","t":"功備於此故先教唯心觀門此"}],"scheme":"cbeta","slug":"cbeta-X-X17n0326-觀楞伽經記保字版卷1","source":"CBETA X17n0326-1 @ xml-p5 dbdea41","total":60,"unit":"X17 頁欄"}